WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.792
Breathe in… four counts.

2
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:07.733
Paco, nobody can follow this thread.

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.282
The coast comes first, with two and a half votes.

4
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:13.891
OK, coast. Book me the house.

5
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.977
Done: Casa Duna, December fifth to eighth.

6
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:28.485
Nora has the dentist tomorrow at five thirty. Leave around five and you'll be there in good time.

7
00:00:29.035 --> 00:00:31.353
And this afternoon, twenty minutes for your back.

8
00:00:32.535 --> 00:00:34.217
Shoulders down. Eyes steady.

9
00:00:40.035 --> 00:00:40.794
Full week.

10
00:00:45.235 --> 00:00:46.241
Thanks, Paco.
